---
import { config } from '../data/config';
---

<section class="cta-section reveal">
  <div class="orb-container">
    <div class="orb"></div>
    <div class="orb-core"></div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="container relative">
    <div class="cta-content text-center">
      <h2>O próximo passo da sua <br/><span class="text-gradient">evolução tecnológica.</span></h2>
      <p>Abrace a engenharia de software de ponta e deixe seus concorrentes lutando com sistemas lentos. O momento de escalar é agora.</p>
      
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href="#orcamento" class="btn-cyber-large">
          <span class="btn-text">Iniciar Projeto Agora</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta-section {
    padding: 10rem 0;
    background-color: #020202;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }
  
  .orb-container {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 600px;
    height: 600px;
    z-index: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  
  .orb {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: conic-gradient(from 0deg, transparent, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3), rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3), transparent);
    filter: blur(40px);
    animation: spin 10s linear infinite;
  }
  
  .orb-core {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%; left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 300px; height: 300px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4) 0%, transparent 70%);
    filter: blur(20px);
  }
  
  @keyframes spin {
    to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
  }
  
  .relative {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
  }
  
  .cta-content {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: rgba(10, 10, 15, 0.7);
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 5rem 3rem;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
  }
  
  .cta-content h2 {
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }
  
  .cta-content p {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }
  
  .btn-cyber-large {
    display: inline-block;
    position: relative;
    padding: 24px 48px;
    background: #0a0a0c;
    color: #fff;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.5);
    border-radius: 8px;
    cursor: pointer;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2);
  }
  
  .btn-cyber-large::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.8), rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.8));
    z-index: 0;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: 0.3s;
  }
  
  .btn-cyber-large:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px) scale(1.02);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4);
    border-color: transparent;
  }
  
  .btn-cyber-large:hover::before {
    opacity: 1;
  }
  
  .btn-text {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .cta-content { padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }
    .cta-content h2 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
  }
</style>
